runCoordinator(port, mainClass, mode, source)
    Reserve a listening socket and obtain its actual port before spawning.
    Bind loopback in script mode; preserve serving-mode addresses otherwise.
    Register coordinator routes, object transport and registry/GC lifecycle.
    In one-shot modes evaluate source, request child shutdown and exit with
    the evaluation status. Script mode requests strict error propagation.

workspace evaluation(source, selector) -> output or error
    Ensure the workspace, call the selected evaluation method, propagate
    transport failures and remote signals, and return captured output.

inspection and MCP routes
    Serve MCP tool discovery and invocation alongside existing browser endpoints.
    Enrich object inspection with sampled root paths and runtime activity.

stale-object probe
    Clear suspicion after a successful response.
    Require repeated failure beyond the reconnect grace before eviction.

Serve navigation index, graph relationship inspection and navigation script endpoints.

Serve POST /workspace and the assisted object-workspace browser script.

Serve interaction, result, recording and view endpoints plus their browser scripts.

Register debugger and trace HTTP/UI routes. Enable tracing on newly registering objects before notifying spawn waiters.

Register the source editing/history API and script; sourceStore serializes definition replacements.

Spawn accepts an optional validated NativeSnapshot, requires matching class and no autoInit/blockDef, and forwards it through local/worker paths. Serve clone/wiring scripts and the graph-object read endpoint.

Serve the Promise browser renderer at /promises.js.

Serve live workbench/catalog data and workbench browser rendering.

Serve selector refactoring previews and their browser script.
